# (build 166) LANGUAGE changed in a fight (formation 1): the painted boxes
# -- the enemy's name, the party's names, FIGHT/STGY -- built again in the
# new language. Until 166 they kept the old one until the fight drew them
# again (the enemy's box never), and his names, runs of his face, were
# blank in another language's.
start battle 1
wait idle
language ja
wait ticks 2
expect pixel 20 22 $EEE        # the dakuten over the enemy box's バ
shot 01_japanese
language retranslation
wait ticks 2
expect pixel 16 24 $EEE        # the top of his B of Biting Ant
shot 02_retranslated
